      "en": "Now when all the people who were with Ishmael saw Johanan the son of Kareah, and all the captains of the forces who were with him, then they were glad.",
      "ko": "이스마엘과 함께 있던 모든 백성이 가레아의 아들 요하난과 그와 함께한 모든 군대장관을 보고 기뻐한지라",
      "source_text_hash": "90a18e20c4cc2cf2c4484fdb9f09f27a4bb5afdb7bb90a483b34d4b9441a29fb",
      "translation_text_hash": "26fb830362a7cf4b51ec7ec1522478c55e6e7ff05a1f84ea3e7c0254484b2216",
