      "en": "They departed and lived in Geruth Chimham, which is by Bethlehem, to go to enter into Egypt",
      "ko": "애굽으로 가려 하여 떠나 베들레헴 근처에 있는 게롯김함에 머무렀으니",
      "source_text_hash": "296d42e7b4d21e3c272761cf882dce6b22cc5b59c2732147ba92a3eed97b0215",
      "translation_text_hash": "0962ce2b94352a4f96e8f747ed203696328280bd8cb9fc32714504168d7b2f46",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
